      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Dense Embedder: BAAI/bge-small-en (384 dims)\n\u2022 FAISS IndexFlatIP (L2 Normalized Inner Product)\n\u2022 Authoritative Corpus:\n  - ADA 2019 Guideline on Antibiotic Use\n  - AAOMP Oral & Maxillofacial Pathology\n  - CDC Infection Prevention in Dental Settings\n\u2022 Performance: Recall@5 = 82.5% | P50 = 7.62 ms",
